    "title": "Publix holidays closed. 9 things to know Florida-based supermarket",
    "text": "NEWSIs Publix open on Christmas? Supermarket closed for 3 holidays every year. What to know Cheryl McCloudUSA TODAY NETWORK - FloridaDec. 20, 2024, 6:00 a.m. ETFlorida-based Publix is the largest grocery store chain in the Sunshine State.Loved for its chicken tender subs and recognized for its emotional holiday commercials, the company has a longstanding policy of being closed for three holidays every year.Now that Thanksgiving is behind us — yes, Publix was closed for that holiday — and Christmas is ahead, here is what you should know about the company, including the holidays it's always closed and when it closes early.",
